Package: ecoeval
Title: Evaluate AI Extraction Accuracy Against a Human Gold Standard
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Nathan", "Layman", , "n8.layman@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2238-6584")))
Description: Provides an interactive Shiny dashboard for measuring how
    accurately an AI extraction pipeline performed against a human-curated
    gold standard. Because two readers describe the same finding differently,
    records must be aligned before they can be compared; ecoeval pairs records
    using probabilistic record linkage, resolves near-matches with a cascade of
    comparators ending in an LLM judge, and reports precision, recall, and
    field-level accuracy. Designed to be run iteratively, surfacing signals
    that distinguish model error from schema misfit.
URL: https://n8layman.github.io/ecoeval/, https://github.com/n8layman/ecoeval
BugReports: https://github.com/n8layman/ecoeval/issues
